  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(x=2 t^2+4, y=4 t+6, \\quad y=4 t+6 \\rightarrow t=\\left(\\frac{y-6}{4}\\right)\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& x=2\\left(\\frac{y-6}{4}\\right)^2+4 \\Rightarrow \\frac{(y-6)^2}{8}=x-4 \\\\\n& (y-6)^2=4(2)(x-4)\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
